OL,3,GNEWSAM&S closure 'devastating' for
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe permanent closure of the Marks and
OL,7,FSpencer (M&S) store in Thurmaston has
OL,8,Fbeen described as "devastating" by a
OL,9,Flocal councillor.
OL,11,FMuch of Thurmaston Shopping Centre, in
OL,12,FBarkby Thorpe Lane, was demolished
OL,13,Ffollowing a fire, which started at
OL,14,Fabout 04:00 BST on 20 June.
OL,16,FM&S has said it hopes to open a new
OL,17,Fstore in the area in the future but has
OL,18,Fnot confirmed any details yet.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
