OL,3,GNEWSAM&S closure 'devastating' for
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrenda Seaton, a parish, district and
OL,7,Fcounty councillor for the village, said
OL,8,Fthe closure was "very disappointing
OL,9,Fnews".
